    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/ede1bfa19b1699cb6b9da3da0b25e880.avif?t=1704479980\" /></span><br><br><strong>Agent Z's new duty is on Karan Country. An intelligent agent Z is ready to do everything in his power to destroy the targeted criminal organization under your control.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/f2f2aebc841a0e00cbbc733be541ad0c.poster.avif?t=1704479980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/f2f2aebc841a0e00cbbc733be541ad0c.webm?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/f2f2aebc841a0e00cbbc733be541ad0c.mp4?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Mission</h2><strong>The criminal organization has taken over almost all the factories in the Karan region. The main goal of Atilla Tartan, who is the ringleader of this criminal organization, is to take Karan under his control and he has almost succeeded. As Agent Z, prevent it and clean up the mess created from Atilla.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/4186f442456a0db915ae033789b30af0.poster.avif?t=1704479980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/4186f442456a0db915ae033789b30af0.webm?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/4186f442456a0db915ae033789b30af0.mp4?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Karan</h2><strong>Karan is an island country with an area of 85 km\u00b2 (33 mi\u00b2) consisting of 9 regions. Hit the road and explore untouched forests, growing cities, wastelands known for their wild animals, towns that preserve their traditional structure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/d996f78f57676e8b3680b29ce5e73d2d.poster.avif?t=1704479980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/d996f78f57676e8b3680b29ce5e73d2d.webm?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/d996f78f57676e8b3680b29ce5e73d2d.mp4?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Open World</h2>You can perform many activities in the open world such as racing with modified cars, cargo transportation missions, farm work with tractors, various aiming challenges in shooting ranges, treasure hunting in forests and wastelands and many more.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/ede1bfa19b1699cb6b9da3da0b25e880.avif?t=1704479980\" /></span><br><br><strong>Agent Z's new duty is on Karan Country. An intelligent agent Z is ready to do everything in his power to destroy the targeted criminal organization under your control.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/f2f2aebc841a0e00cbbc733be541ad0c.poster.avif?t=1704479980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/f2f2aebc841a0e00cbbc733be541ad0c.webm?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/f2f2aebc841a0e00cbbc733be541ad0c.mp4?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Mission</h2><strong>The criminal organization has taken over almost all the factories in the Karan region. The main goal of Atilla Tartan, who is the ringleader of this criminal organization, is to take Karan under his control and he has almost succeeded. As Agent Z, prevent it and clean up the mess created from Atilla.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/4186f442456a0db915ae033789b30af0.poster.avif?t=1704479980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/4186f442456a0db915ae033789b30af0.webm?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/4186f442456a0db915ae033789b30af0.mp4?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Karan</h2><strong>Karan is an island country with an area of 85 km\u00b2 (33 mi\u00b2) consisting of 9 regions. Hit the road and explore untouched forests, growing cities, wastelands known for their wild animals, towns that preserve their traditional structure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/d996f78f57676e8b3680b29ce5e73d2d.poster.avif?t=1704479980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/d996f78f57676e8b3680b29ce5e73d2d.webm?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290960/extras/d996f78f57676e8b3680b29ce5e73d2d.mp4?t=1704479980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Open World</h2>You can perform many activities in the open world such as racing with modified cars, cargo transportation missions, farm work with tractors, various aiming challenges in shooting ranges, treasure hunting in forests and wastelands and many more.</strong>",
